+## invoices
+
+- `invoices.invoices_by_status(status)`: invoices whose status is `status`, sorted by id; returns an empty list if none match. Read-only, so safe to retry. Raises `E_BAD_INPUT` if `status` is not `"open"` or `"paid"`.
+
 ## rates
 
 - `rates.quote(weight_kg, zone)`: price for a weight and zone
